  "key_equation": {
    "name": "Predictive coding update (precision-weighted)",
    "latex": "\\dot\\mu_\\ell = -\\partial_\\mu F \\approx \\pi_\\ell^{-1} \\varepsilon_\\ell - \\pi_{\\ell-1}\\, \\partial g_\\ell/\\partial\\mu_\\ell \\cdot \\varepsilon_{\\ell-1} - \\Lambda(\\mu_\\ell - m_\\ell)",
    "description": "Hierarchical update: bottom-up driving by own-level error, top-down correction by below-level error scaled by generative model Jacobian, and lateral prior pull. Equivalent to gradient descent on variational free energy."
